n</details>\n\n\nWhen the `Dealer` scene is opened, the error message appears only once. Upon closing, multiple error messages appear, depending on the number of MeshInstance3D instances. This error message also appears when opening the scene even without MeshInstance3D instances. The error message disappears as soon as `Skeleton3D` is deleted.\n\n\n<details><summary>screenshot</summary>\n\n<img width=\"430\" height=\"382\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2130fce0-320f-45fc-9cff-a4cf0c96e725\" />\n\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587436514/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587468814","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111678#issuecomment-3587468814","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111678","id":3587468814,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7V1G4O","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/rec